285
00:17:33,125 --> 00:17:35,125
ellos solo son patéticos.

286
00:17:36,458 --> 00:17:38,365
<i>Es verdad, KittenKween.</i>

287
00:17:41,192 --> 00:17:43,685
Por cierto, si quieres acabar,
puse un arnés

288
00:17:43,758 --> 00:17:46,480
