330
00:20:17,458 --> 00:20:18,845
Está allí.

331
00:20:53,658 --> 00:20:55,245
¿Tú lo hiciste?

332
00:20:58,958 --> 00:21:00,605
La verdad que no.

333
00:21:02,125 --> 00:21:03,685
¿Lo admitiste?

334
00:21:05,992 --> 00:21:07,092
No.

335
00:21:10,658 --> 00:21:12,125
¿Lo hiciste?

336
00:21:22,458 --> 00:21:23,625
No.

337
00:21:27,125 --> 00:21:28,725
Es bueno oírlo.

338
00:21:32,792 --> 00:21:34,925
Su familia presentará cargos.

339
00:21:37,558 --> 00:21:38,885
Demonios.

340
00:21:42,292 --> 00:21:43,685
Escúchame.

341
00:21:45,125 --> 00:21:47,085
Debes mantener la calma.

342
00:21:47,858 --> 00:21:49,758
No te enojes
y no hagas una escena.

343
00:21:49,792 --> 00:21:52,325
Sal de la escuela
con la frente en alto.

344
00:21:54,525 --> 00:21:57,158
Mírame. ¡Mírame!

345
00:22:01,158 --> 00:22:03,285
Lo que está por pasarte a ti,

346
00:22:04,358 --> 00:22:08,425
